  "banks": {
   "confidence": "drawing",
   "note": "drawing - the front view labels the first three blocks 'B1 [DARK GRAY]' and the last three 'B2 [LIGHT GRAY]', over breakers B1 and B2. THAT B1 FEEDS THE FIRST THREE BLOCKS IS A READING OF THE LABELS: no sentence held says it. The two greys are drawn as #55585c and #9a9da1 and are estimates of the words: no photograph is held."
